 AWI Senior Vice President and CFO Chris Calzaretta", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/7431/000119312526427906/awi-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-07-30", "n": 8.99, "z": 2.1, "rz": 3.69, "q": "As Armstrong continues to evolve and grow, our people remain central to our success,", "a": "said Mark Hershey, president and chief executive officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/7431/000119312526324992/awi-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-07-28", "n": 3.09, "z": -1.41, "rz": -1.21, "q": "Consistent execution across our enterprise and continued contributions from our growth initiatives drove record quarterly net sales, operating income and adjusted EBITDA, with solid performance in both segments,", "a": "said AWI President and CEO, Mark Hershey", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/7431/000119312526318759/awi-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-07-21", "n": 4.55, "z": -0.34, "rz": -1.08, "q": "I'm pleased to announce the Board’s approval of this $800 million increase in our share repurchase authorization which, along with our quarterly dividend, reflects the fundamental strength of our business model and its ability to consistently generate strong Adjusted Free Cash Flow,", "a": "said Chris Calzaretta, SVP and CFO of Armstrong World Industries", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/7431/000119312526310382/awi-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-04-28", "n": 4.25, "z": -0.55, "rz": -1.53, "q": "We delivered solid topline growth this quarter, driven by Mineral Fiber AUV and higher volumes, along with double-digit sales growth in Architectural Specialties,", "a": "said AWI President and CEO, Mark Hershey", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/7431/000119312526183353/awi-ex99_1.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-10-27", "z": -0.2, "mood": "usual"}, "say_do": {"mood": "usual", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 49, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "cov